otic_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_38","text":"Don't you know it's inappropriate to pry into a girl's private affairs? :(","jump":"m_ex_exotic_02_45"},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_39","text":"What, haven't you heard of a time capsule before?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_40","text":"I took some items that remind me of you, put them in a container,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_41","text":"then buried them. It's a way to commemorate our time together.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_42","text":"You're a smartie pants, so I'm sure you already know this should be kept a secret, right? ;)","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_43","text":"My lips are sealed.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_44","text":"You're the best, Honey!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_45","text":"Jackal.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_46","text":"Find another spot to bury the capsule.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_47","text":"Make it snappy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_48","text":"I'm on it!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_49","text":"As for you...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_50","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_50","text":"Yes?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_51","text":"Next time Jackal goes off on a tangent,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_52","text":"just ignore her.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_53","text":"If you encourage her, she'll end up doing it more than she already does.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_54","text":"And I don't think any of us want that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_55","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_55","text":"I can't just ignore her.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_56","text":"Sorry for interrupting,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_57","text":"but some friends are expecting us.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_58","text":"We really ought to get going.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_59","text":"All right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_60","text":"Off we go then!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_exotic_02_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_exotic_02_61","text":"If you have any questions, just shoot me a message.","jump":null}],"chat":true}